    "https://brevard.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Final-draft-of-ENG-position-description-1.pdf": {
      "title": "Assistant Professor of English, focusing on First Year Writing, to begin in the fall 2027 semester",
      "description": " \nBrevard\n \nCollege\n \n \nFall\n \n2027\n \n \nAssistant\n \nProfessor\n \nof\n \nEnglish\n \n \n \nBrevard\n \nCollege\n \nseeks\n \nan\n \nexcellent\n \nteacher\n \nto\n \nfill\n \na\n \ntenure-track,\n \nnine-month\n \nfaculty\n \nposition\n \nas\n \nan\n \nAssistant\n \nProfessor\n \nof\n \nEnglish,\n \nfocusing\n \non\n \nFirst\n \nYear\n \nWriting,\n \nto\n \nbegin\n \nin\n \nthe\n \nfall\n \n2027\n \nsemester.\n \nApplicants\n \nmust\n \nhold\n \na\n \nterminal\n \ndegree\n \nin\n \nRhetoric\n \nand\n \nComposition,\n \nWriting\n \nStudies,\n \nEnglish,\n \nor\n \nanother\n \nrelevant\n \nfield,\n \nwith\n \nthe\n \ndegree\n \nin\n \nhand\n \nby\n \nthe\n \nstarting\n \ndate.\n \n \n \nCandidates\n \nshould\n \ndemonstrate\n \na\n \nrecord\n \nof,\n \nor\n \npotential\n \nfor,\n \nexcellence\n \nin\n \nall\n \nlevels\n \nof\n \nundergraduate\n \nteaching,\n \nbut\n \npreference\n \nwill\n \nbe\n \ngiven\n \nto\n \ncandidates\n \nwho\n \nemploy\n \nexperiential\n \npedagogies\n \nwith\n \nevidence\n \nof\n \nexcellence\n \nat\n \nteaching\n \nfirst-year\n \nwriting.\n \nThe\n \nsuccessful\n \ncandidate\n \nwill\n \ncontribute\n \nto\n \na\n \nthriving\n \nprogram\n \nin\n \nEnglish\n \nand\n \ndemonstrate\n \na\n \nstrong\n \ncommitment\n \nto\n \nteaching\n \nand\n \nmentoring\n \nstudents\n \nwithin\n \na\n \ndiverse\n \nliberal\n \narts\n \nenvironment.\n \n \nThe\n \nstandard\n \nteaching\n \nload\n \nis\n \n12\n \ncredit\n \nhours\n \nper\n \nsemester.\n \nIn\n \naddition\n \nto\n \nteaching,\n \nfaculty\n \nmembers\n \nmaintain\n \nan\n \nappropriate\n \nlevel\n \nof\n \nprofessional\n \ndevelopment\n \nand\n \nscholarly\n \nactivity\n \nand\n \ncontribute\n \nto\n \nthe\n \nlife\n \nof\n \nthe\n \ncollege\n \nthrough\n \nacademic\n \nadvising,\n \nprogram\n \nassessment,\n \ncommittee\n \nwork,\n \nand\n \nother\n \ninstitutional\n \nand\n \nprofessional\n \nservice.\n  \n \n \nBrevard\n \nCollege,\n \nfounded\n \nin\n \n1853,\n \nis\n \na\n \nresidential\n \nliberal\n \narts\n \ncollege.\n \nSituated\n \nin\n \nthe\n \nheart\n \nof\n \nthe\n \nBlue\n \nRidge\n \nMountains,\n \nBrevard\n \nCollege\n \nis\n \nlocated\n \n33\n \nmiles\n \nsouthwest\n \nof\n \nAsheville,\n \nNorth\n \nCarolina.\n \nBrevard\n \nCollege\n \nis\n \ncommitted\n \nto\n \nan\n \nexperiential\n \nliberal\n \narts\n \neducation\n \nthat\n \nencourages\n \npersonal\n \ngrowth\n \nand\n \ninspires\n \nartistic,\n \nintellectual,\n \nand\n \nsocial\n \naction.\n \nOur\n \nfaculty\n \npurposefully\n \nengage\n \nwith\n \nlearners\n \nin\n \ndirect\n \nexperience\n \nand\n \nfocused\n \nreflections\n \nin\n \norder\n \nto\n \nincrease\n \nknowledge,\n \ndevelop\n \nskills,\n \nand\n \nclarify\n \nvalues.\n \nWe\n \nconsistently\n \nrank\n \namong\n \nthe\n \ntop\n \nschools\n \nin\n \nboth\n \nUndergraduate\n \nTeaching\n \nand\n \nMost\n \nInnovative\n \nSchools\n \nby\n \nUS\n \nNews\n \nand\n \nWorld\n \nReport.\n \n \n \nThe\n \nstarting\n \ndate\n \nfor\n \nthis\n \nposition\n \nis\n \nAugust\n \n2027.\n \nReview\n \nof\n \napplications\n \nwill\n \nbegin\n \nimmediately\n \nand\n \ncontinue\n \nuntil\n \nthe\n \nposition\n \nis\n \nfilled,\n \nbut\n \npreference\n \nwill\n \nbe\n \ngiven\n \nto\n \nthose\n \nreceived\n \nbefore\n \nDecember\n \n1.\n \nBrevard\n \nCollege\n \nseeks\n \nto\n \nrecruit\n \nand\n \nretain\n \na\n \ndiverse\n \nworkforce\n \nand\n \nencourages\n \nqualified\n \ncandidates\n \nacross\n \nall\n \ndemographic\n \ngroups\n \nto\n \napply.\n \n \n \nApplicants\n \nshould\n \nemail\n \n(1)\n \na\n \nletter\n \nof\n \napplication\n \ndescribing\n \nthe\n \napplicant’s\n \nqualifications\n \nrelevant\n \nto\n \nteaching\n \nat\n \nBrevard\n \nCollege;\n \n(2)\n \na\n \nstatement\n \nof\n \nteaching\n \nphilosophy;\n \n(3)\n \na\n \ncurriculum\n \nvitae\n \ndocumenting\n \nrelevant\n \nexperience,\n \nas\n \nwell\n \nas\n \ncourses\n \nthe\n \napplicant\n \nhas\n \ntaught\n \nand\n \nis\n \nprepared\n \nto\n \nteach;\n \n(4)\n \na\n \nsample\n \nsyllabus\n \nfrom\n \na\n \nrecent\n \nwriting\n \ncourse;\n \nand\n \n(5)\n \nnames\n \nand\n \ncontact\n \ninformation\n \nfor\n \nthree\n \nprofessional\n \nreferences,\n \nat\n \nleast\n \none\n \nof\n \nwhom\n \nshould\n \ntypically\n \nbe\n \nan\n \napplicant’s\n \ncurrent\n \nor\n \nrecent\n \nsupervisor.\n \n \n \nSubmit\n \nmaterials\n \nto\n \nChair\n \nof\n \nthe\n \nEnglish\n \nSearch\n \nCommittee:\n \nEnglishSearch@brevard.edu\n \n \nBrevard\n \nCollege\n \nis\n \nan\n \nEqual\n \nOpportunity\n \nEmployer.\n \nIn\n \norder\n \nto\n \nprovide\n \na\n \nsafe\n \nand\n \nproductive\n \nlearning\n \nand\n \nliving\n \nenvironment,\n \nBrevard\n \nCollege\n \nconducts\n \nbackground\n \ninvestigations\n \non\n \nall\n \nfinal\n \ncandidates\n \nbeing\n \nconsidered\n \nfor\n \nemployment.\n \nAdditional\n \ninformation\n \nis\n \navailable\n \nat\n \nthe\n \nCollege\n \nwebsite,\n \nwww.brevard.edu.\n \n"
