    "https://brevard.edu/career-exploration-development/": {
      "title": "Career Exploration and Development Additional Resources",
      "description": "Career Exploration and Development Additional Resources | Brevard College Skip to content Menu More for your Career Additional Resources from the Office of Career Exploration, Advising, Development, & Support Additional Webpages for the Office of Career Exploration, Advising, Development, and Support (opens in new tab) Career Ready Compentencies Career Pathways Career Planning Your most valuable Resource: Connections You'll make lifelong connections with your faculty, staff, students, Trustees, and community members. Often times, when starting your career it's not what you know but who you know. We're Here to help! If you have questions about the Office of Career Exploration, Advising, Development, and Support, please contact the Director, Nacole Potts, at nacole.potts@brevard.edu or call 828.641.0325. Post a Job or Internship Here (opens in new tab) POST A Job or internship here Post a Position (opens in new tab) 80% OF EMPLOYERS WANT THE SKILLS ASSOCIATED WITH A DEGREE FROM BREVARD 1-on-1 HELP AND ASSISTANCE WITH CAREER PLANNING TOP COLLEGE FOR STUDENTS WHO ARE UNDECIDED One Brevard College Dr. (opens in new tab) Brevard, NC 28712 (opens in new tab) 828.641.0641 (opens in new tab) admissions@brevard.edu (opens in new tab) (opens in new tab) (opens in new tab) Brevard College is consistently recognized as one of the best liberal arts colleges. The College's focus on experiential learning, small class sizes, and location in the mountains of Western North Carolina near Asheville make Brevard a top choice college for students around the world. Consumer Disclosure Terms of Use (opens in new tab) Title IX (opens in new tab) Privacy Policy (opens in new tab) Whistleblower Policy (opens in new tab) MyBrevard © 2026 Brevard College This institution is an equal opportunity provider. Want to learn more? Sign up to download our quick fact sheet & stay up to date with Brevard College! Footer Interest Capture First Name * Last Name * Email * Graduating Year * If you are human, leave this field blank. Request Δ Academics Majors Minors & Concentrations Undergraduate Research Conference Graduate Programs Brevard Career Advantage Honors Program Find Your Career Path Admissions & Aid Apply for Admission Apply for Scholarships & Aid Confirm My Offer of Admission (Direct Admission) Pay My Enrollment Fee Register for a Scholarship Competition Register for Student Orientation Advising and Registration (S.O.A.R!) Schedule My Campus Visit Tuition & Fees Forms Campus Life Campus Life Graduation Information Clubs & Student Involvement New Student Center Student Success Career Services Outdoor Adventures The Town of Brevard Athletics Campus Ministry Institute for Women in Leadership Residence Life & Dorms Alumni & Friends Make a Gift Annual Fund Homecoming! Planned Giving New Student Center Donor Recognition Alumni Association Refer a Student About Brevard Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Brevard at a Glance Brevard Career Advantage Remarkable Outcomes New Student Center News Events Campus Map The Porter Center for the Performing Arts The J.A. Jones Library & ELC Contact Us Directory Post a Job or Internship Career Opportunities at Brevard Apply Visit Direct Admission Scholarships Pay My Enrollment Fee Make a Gift Apply Visit Pay My Enrollment Fee Pay My Bill Give Athletics MyBrevard (opens in new tab) News Apply Visit Pay My Enrollment Fee Pay My Bill Give Athletics MyBrevard (opens in new tab) News"
