    "https://brevard.edu/employment-opportunities/": {
      "title": "Employment Opportunities",
      "description": "Employment Opportunities | Join the Team | Brevard College Skip to content Menu Make a difference in the Lives of Students Join the Team NC College Job Openings Brevard College Employment Opportunities Brevard College is currently seeking qualified candidates to fill the following positions. Please click on the position title to view the description and the position’s specific application information. All applicants will be assessed in accordance with Brevard College’s Equal Opportunity and Nondiscrimination Policy. Brevard College's Language Access Plan (LAP) is available at the Office of Human Resources located in Beam Administration Hall. This institution is an equal opportunity provider. Faculty Openings Assistant Professor of English If interested in an Adjunct Professor position in a discipline not listed above, please email a copy of your resume or CV to vp-aa@brevard.edu to be considered for future opportunities. Staff Openings Coordinator of Annual Giving, Communications, Alumni Relations Dishwasher Lead Cook Sous Chef Director of Admissions and Financial Aid Brevard College does not discriminate in admissions, educational programs, or employment on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, disability, or veteran’s status and prohibits such discrimination by its students, faculty, and staff. Students, faculty, and staff are assured of participation in college programs and in use of facilities without such discrimination. The College also complies with all applicable federal and North Carolina statutes and regulations prohibiting unlawful discrimination. All members of the student body, faculty, and staff are expected to assist in making this policy valid in fact. Title IX Training (opens in new tab) Top College for Innovation Top Best Private College Work at a Private College Driven by Excellence Top College in the South According to U.S. News and World Report's Best Colleges edition One Brevard College Dr. (opens in new tab) Brevard, NC 28712 (opens in new tab) 828.641.0641 (opens in new tab) admissions@brevard.edu (opens in new tab) (opens in new tab) (opens in new tab) Brevard College is consistently recognized as one of the best liberal arts colleges. The College's focus on experiential learning, small class sizes, and location in the mountains of Western North Carolina near Asheville make Brevard a top choice college for students around the world. Consumer Disclosure Terms of Use (opens in new tab) Title IX (opens in new tab) Privacy Policy (opens in new tab) Whistleblower Policy (opens in new tab) MyBrevard © 2026 Brevard College This institution is an equal opportunity provider. Want to learn more? Sign up to download our quick fact sheet & stay up to date with Brevard College! Footer Interest Capture First Name * Last Name * Email * Graduating Year * If you are human, leave this field blank. Request Δ Academics Majors Minors & Concentrations Undergraduate Research Conference Graduate Programs Brevard Career Advantage Honors Program Find Your Career Path Admissions & Aid Apply for Admission Apply for Scholarships & Aid Confirm My Offer of Admission (Direct Admission) Pay My Enrollment Fee Register for a Scholarship Competition Register for Student Orientation Advising and Registration (S.O.A.R!) Schedule My Campus Visit Tuition & Fees Forms Campus Life Campus Life Graduation Information Clubs & Student Involvement New Student Center Student Success Career Services Outdoor Adventures The Town of Brevard Athletics Campus Ministry Institute for Women in Leadership Residence Life & Dorms Alumni & Friends Make a Gift Annual Fund Homecoming! Planned Giving New Student Center Donor Recognition Alumni Association Refer a Student About Brevard Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) Brevard at a Glance Brevard Career Advantage Remarkable Outcomes New Student Center News Events Campus Map The Porter Center for the Performing Arts The J.A. Jones Library & ELC Contact